  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Callichimaera perplexa. Colour, inflated soft volume and chosen resting/swimming pose are interpretive. No arbitrary enlarged eyes beyond source proportions; distal leg lamellae follow fossil/reconstruction evidence. Sex-neutral simplified pleon, no claim of reproductive microanatomy.",
    "zh": "Callichimaera perplexa 的活体复原。颜色、软组织体积和静止或游泳姿态为解释；足端薄片参考化石与复原证据，腹部作性别中性的简化，不表现繁殖微解剖。"
  },
